# .cursorrules — Cursor Agent Pointers & Directives

# 🛑 AUTHORITATIVE RULEBOOKS & DOCUMENTATION POINTERS
- Refer to AGENTS.md at root for universal AI agent rules, token-sparing protocols, theme token directives, tech stack matrix, and command reference.
- Refer to docs/context/index.md for module sitemap, architecture layers, domain entities, state machines, and API contracts.

# ⚡ STRICT CONTEXT SCOPING PROTOCOL
- NEVER scan or load the entire repository into context.
- Scope code inspection exclusively to the target feature folder (`src/features/[feature]/`).
- Do NOT re-read large schema files unless resolving type definitions.

# 🚀 QUICK COMMANDS
- Dev: `npm run dev`
- Build: `npm run build`
- Typecheck: `npx tsc --noEmit`
- Test: `npm run test`
- DB: `npm run db:generate` | `npm run db:migrate` | `npm run db:seed`
- MCP: `npm run mcp:start`
